cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use MaveScape in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "MaveScape"
abstract: "A workbench for multiplexed assays of variant effect (MAVEs) and deep mutational scanning: import of variant counts and published scores, experiment design, quality control, uncertainty-aware variant-effect scores, maps, comparison and protein structure, with every analysis decision recorded. It runs locally as one self-contained program, needs no other software, and keeps the user's files on their computer."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: McDermott
    given-names: Robert
repository-code: "https://github.com/robert-mcdermott/mavescape"
license: Apache-2.0
version: 0.2.0
date-released: 2026-10-10
keywords:
  - deep mutational scanning
  - multiplexed assays of variant effect
  - MAVE
  - variant effect
  - functional genomics
  - protein structure
